65
00:05:23.961 --> 00:05:30.595
NARRATOR: On screen, show a checklist graphic
with items like 'Whiteboard', 'Projection

66
00:05:30.595 --> 00:05:35.570
System', 'Textbooks', and 'Online Resources'
for faculty to mark.

67
00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:42.059
NARRATOR: State the benefit, the cost, and the
condition under which the tradeoff is

68
00:05:42.059 --> 00:05:42.523
acceptable.

69
00:05:42.523 --> 00:05:49.664
NARRATOR: Making the tradeoff visible prevents
a local improvement from hiding a larger cost.

70
00:05:49.778 --> 00:05:56.638
NARRATOR: Stress-test the reasoning around
Evaluation Criteria for Proposals with an edge

71
00:05:56.638 --> 00:06:01.212
