the outcome.

72
00:06:01.212 --> 00:06:05.618
NARRATOR: Recurrences describe the cost of
recursive algorithms.

73
00:06:05.618 --> 00:06:11.857
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: The
proposal is evaluated based on whether it

74
00:06:11.857 --> 00:06:18.096
meets Theory cluster standards and whether the
proposed resources are sufficient for a

75
00:06:18.096 --> 00:06:19.056
